## Post-work comment template

Post a single structured comment on the issue after capture and review. This is
the **mandatory closing comment** for all UI tickets. For local-only trackers, use local
scratch paths and state that upload is not required. For an explicitly
attachment-capable publication flow, add the returned attachment URLs.

```markdown
## Visual Review — {Ticket title}

**URL tested:** `http://localhost:3000/{route}` (or Storybook `{story-id}`)
**Phase:** Before → After comparison
**Viewports:** mobile, tablet_p, tablet_l, desktop
**Capture directory:** `/absolute/agent-fs/session/scratch/path`
**Publication:** not required (local-only tracker) / explicitly published ({adapter})

