## Troubleshooting

| Problem                                         | Solution                                                                                                                                       |
| ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Dev server not running                          | From a worktree, just run the CLI — it auto-starts the dev server. From the main checkout: `pnpm dev` then retry.                              |
| Port belongs to a different worktree            | Add `--attach-existing` to reuse it, or use a different port number.                                                                           |
| Storybook not running                           | `pnpm storybook` — wait for port 6006                                                                                                          |
| App route is down but Storybook is up           | Switch to a Storybook `iframe.html?id=...` target and continue the visual workflow there                                                       |
| Route requires auth                             | Use `--storage-state /path/to/state.json` from `pnpm exec playwright codegen --save-storage`                                                   |
| Captures contradict each other across runs      | You likely captured from different localhost servers/checkouts. Run one dedicated server on a unique port and capture only from that base URL. |
| Screenshot is blank / white                     | Increase `--stable-timeout=20000` for async-data routes                                                                                        |
| Screenshot shows spinner/loading state          | Use a wait script (`--script`) with networkidle + short settle delay, then re-capture                                                          |
| Story loads blank                               | Use `/iframe.html?id=...` not `/?path=/story/...`                                                                                              |
| CLI reports `playwright not found` (exit 3)     | Run from a project subtree where `node_modules/playwright` exists, or `pnpm exec playwright install`                                           |
| `chromium.launch failed`                        | `pnpm exec playwright install chromium` from the workspace                                                                                     |
| ffmpeg not found                                | `brew install ffmpeg` (macOS)                                                                                                                  |
| Explicit attachment upload 400                  | Attachment-capable flow only: publish contact sheet PNG, not the WebM                                                                          |
| Explicit attachment upload 401                  | Attachment-capable flow only: check tracker credentials; this is not a local-only-tracker close blocker                                         |
| Contact sheet missing / blank                   | Check `python3 -c "import PIL"` — install with `pip3 install Pillow` if missing                                                                |
| Contact sheet shows only spinner                | Evidence is invalid — re-capture with a longer wait in the interaction script before closing                                                   |
| Need screenshots in chat instead of on an issue | Save under a workspace path, then open with the image viewer to render inline                                                                  |
